OL,3,GNEWSAGroups unite for long-term
OL,4,Arecovery after wildfire
OL,5,
OL,6,FOrganisations involved in the response
OL,7,Fto a wildfire have united for the
OL,8,Flonger-term recovery of the impacted
OL,9,Fareas, businesses and communities.
OL,11,FThe fire in the New Forest, which
OL,12,Fstarted on 9 August after a van on the
OL,13,FA31 caught fire, affected more than 100
OL,14,Fhectares of heathland and led to the
OL,15,Fclosure of the dual carriageway.
OL,17,FWith the fire now extinguished and the
OL,18,FA31 reopened, the district council said
OL,19,Fthe focus had moved to how to support
OL,20,Fthe affected communities, businesses,
OL,21,Fand landscape.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
